  "title": "Easy Oven-Roasted Chicken Gyros",
  "description": "This fun, easy oven-roasted chicken gyro recipe features a Greek-inspired marinade that&#39;s full of flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "NicoleMcmom"
  ],
